OL,3,GNEWSAChernobyl's effect on NI, a
OL,4,AChristmas card row and Casement Park -
OL,5,Agovernment files
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Chernobyl nuclear disaster led to
OL,8,Ffears that milk, meat and vegetables in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland were contaminated with
OL,10,Fradioactive material.
OL,12,FChecks on foodstuffs were carried out
OL,13,Fafter a radioactive cloud passed over
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland in early May 1986.
OL,16,FThat is according to government files
OL,17,Fnow made public.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
